  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ubukerarugendo Imbere Project(Improved market oriented skills of the youth in the tourism and hospitality sector in Rwanda).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to improve market-oriented skills for the youth in the Tourism and Hospitality sector in Rwanda. This programme is built on 5 pillars, covering institutional and managerial capacity of TVET providers in the T&amp;H (1), quality and relevance of TVET provision in the T&amp;amp;H(2), development and promotion of industrial based training(3) , the recognition of the prior learning and experience in the T&amp;amp;H sector (4) and professional and business support to T&amp;amp;H graduates in Rwanda(5).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
